# Pedestrians: `ped spawn` puts 24 walkers on the sidewalks around you (Valencia here), all within
# 100 m; teleport to Dolores Park and they come back around you there, three a tick. (In the squeezed
# city the park is 200 m from the Valencia shops: one walker, near Valencia and 15th St, is 127 m off,
# inside despawn's 130 m, so it walks on where it is and 23 come back.)
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 ped spawn
cmd 1200 teleport dolores_ledges
run 1400
expect peds.alive == 24 at 2
expect peds.near == 24 at 2
expect peds.near == 24 at 1100
expect peds.near < 10 at 1201
expect peds.near == 23 at 1220
expect no event pedHit
